    <string name="faq_title">Frequently asked questions</string>
    <string name="faq_q1">How are hosts verified?</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">A host appears only after our team reviews their details, photos and safety document and records an electrical safety check. Unverified listings are never shown.</string>
    <string name="faq_q2">Why can\'t I see the host\'s exact address?</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">To protect hosts\' privacy, the map shows an approximate area. The exact address is shared with you only after the host accepts your request, and only while the visit is active.</string>
    <string name="faq_q3">What is the session PIN?</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">When a host accepts, you get a 4-digit PIN. Show it to the host only at the charging point; they enter it to start charging, which confirms the right vehicle is present.</string>
    <string name="faq_q4">Does the app measure the energy I use?</string>
